{"id":"prepositions-0061","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 61","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"on","accept":["upon"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Our picnic depends ___ the weather.","hint":"depend ___","explanation":"depend ON (upon in formal style)."},{"answer":"with","accept":["between"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She has a good relationship ___ her students.","hint":"relationship ___ sb","explanation":"a relationship WITH somebody (BETWEEN two parties)."},{"answer":"about","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The kids are crazy ___ the new video game.","hint":"crazy ___ sth (love)","explanation":"crazy ABOUT something = love it enthusiastically."},{"answer":"into","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Further research ___ the disease is needed.","hint":"research ___ sth","explanation":"research INTO a subject (less commonly \u0027on\u0027)."},{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"I\u0027m still waiting for a reply ___ my complaint.","hint":"reply ___ sth","explanation":"a reply TO a letter/complaint/question."},{"answer":"about","accept":["by"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"He was upset ___ losing his keys.","hint":"upset ___ sth","explanation":"upset ABOUT something (BY also possible)."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Critics attacked the film ___ its slow pace.","hint":"criticise sth ___ sth","explanation":"criticise/criticize something FOR a reason."},{"answer":"from","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Two prisoners escaped ___ the high-security wing.","hint":"escape ___ a place","explanation":"escape FROM a place (American English also allows a bare object)."}]}